WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.801
-Guys, we have exactly
nine shows left before

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.267
we go on Christmas break,
which means it is time

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:05.567
for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:07.834
It's time for
"12 Days of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:09.000
Come on.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.334
-♪ 12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:16.167
♪ 9 days left ♪

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.234
-That is right.

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.734
Every show between
now and Christmas,

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:22.167
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:24.901
a noice Christmas sweater
from the

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:26.834
"Countdown to
Christmas Cabinet."

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:27.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:32.367
Now, since there are
nine shows left,

00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:35.667
let's open door number 9.

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:36.868
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:37.968
You ready, bud?
-Yeah.

00:00:37.968 --> 00:00:40.334
-Yeah, here we go.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:42.267
Oh, let's take a look at it.
Yeah.

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:44.901
♪♪
Let's take a peek at it.

00:00:46.434 --> 00:00:48.434
Oh, my gosh.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.100
Wow.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.701
That is --
You could tell by the reaction.

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:54.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:56.667
You could tell by
the reaction in the audience

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:58.734
that everyone
wants to wear this.

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:01.734
It is gorgeous.
"Noel," it says on there.

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:03.667
So, let's see who is going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.400
Everyone look at
your seat number, okay?

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.634
And if I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:08.667
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:09.667
-Yep.
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:11.400
-Who wants a sweater?!
Come on!

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:12.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:19.167
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:20.834
Come on down!
♪♪

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:38.601
Nice to see you, buddy.

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:41.601
Right there, pal.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.033
Have a spot over there.

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:45.801
Hello. What is your name?
And where are you from?

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.868
-My name is Donovan,
and I'm from London.

00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:49.634
-Yeah, that's what
I'm talking about!

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:50.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.033
Donovan from London.

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:54.267
Well, Donovan, it does get cold
in London, doesn't it?

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:55.601
-Very cold now, yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:57.934
-And do you have anything
like this in your wardrobe?

00:01:57.934 --> 00:01:59.534
-No way, man.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:03.000
-Yeah, no way --
-This is the first time.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.300
-Yeah. It's one of a kind.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.067
Do you want to try it on?
Yeah, over the sweatshirt, yeah.

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:11.601
-Yeah, I'll put it on.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:13.434
-There's no real front or back.
Don't worry about that.

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:16.534
Yeah, I don't even know if there
are holes in it, to be honest.

00:02:16.534 --> 00:02:17.634
I don't know if you can
put your head through,

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:19.267
but this -- Look at this.

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:24.033
Oh, no, Don, I can already tell.
I could already tell.

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:26.200
I could already tell.
Oh, my goodness!

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.434
I could already tell.
This is looking good.

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:31.767
Look at that!
Come on, now.

00:02:31.767 --> 00:02:32.868
Don, spin around.

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:35.467
Yeah, let me see it!
Let me see it.

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:38.467
Oh!
[ Laughs ]

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:41.501
That's what I'm talking about.
Yo! Congratulations!

00:02:41.501 --> 00:02:43.133
It looks great on you.

00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:44.133
Let's give our winner
a round of applause.

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:45.234
Stick around.

00:02:45.234 --> 00:02:47.133
We'll be back with
"Show Me Something Good"

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.167
talent show.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:49.434
Come on back.

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:50.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

